     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "Above the bed, A2 is often the sweet spot — large enough to be the focal point but not so dominant that it overwhelms the space. If your bed has a tall headboard, consider hanging the print slightly higher than you normally would. For bedside walls or the space above a chest of drawers, A3 works perfectly.",
